  "id": "baked-barbecue-chicken-with-sweet-potato-and-cranberries",
  "name": "Baked Barbecue Chicken with Sweet Potato and Cranberries",
  "subtitle": "A sweet-savory chicken bake with tender vegetables and fruit.",
  "description": "Chicken breasts bake with barbecue sauce, sweet potato, carrots, apple, onion, and dried cranberries for an easy American-style dinner.",
